ouse brain, and at recent growth rates, they could reach the range of a human brain within five to 10 years.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/19/could-ai-be-conscious">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;AlpQtaqXApd8IdFi17qePoLga3E1GNjaQ_pZTH2-bJQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkvCould AI be conscious?ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;QxqbS2WybZBd4wcPnB3vGzFs2BokWjmWzFWjR7bZKMUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;tKY2goLikA793L1dT27RAyDcTWzx7PiwVYzeOhFD9wQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxHhttps://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/19/could-ai-be-consciousƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;RlHxdmtCjEOWUn1jOHsWT3KkDjAkz8SnRowgYPqXyNQƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkucould-ai-be-consciousƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;B9O8MiNaJyV1up5tJVMsjbiL_CUFBYbCtoRrq1qf70Mƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;sUSDKdfhSBi5UiYcQ4y7KTuz4UvNiGzbcXM5PGJRfg0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjtechnologyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;122g9Bo1qPcCfRxWmhU5BosHOnSS4C9-h5X6QVpQ4jgƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;kFxd-5PH4cQaSYxynkR2Fqlk96JF0dHRUT8mFQwPcCYƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;WR98YjyM8Yo4pnMnEJbTTItqBRS7dR-2cDXJFkkKqt0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftd